# Build output installed here by `scripts/build.cjs`. Committing a 2.5 MB addon
# and two DLLs would put binaries in the repo and guarantee a stale one is
# eventually loaded; `package.json`'s `files` list is what ships them.
aethervfs.node
vfs_shim_dll.dll
vfs_payload.dll

# The stand-in executable the demo launches. Built, not authored.
fixtures/

# The package has npm **devDependencies** as of the TypeScript migration —
# vitest, typescript and @types/node — and no runtime dependencies, which is the
# part that was always deliberate. `pnpm-lock.yaml` is committed (it is the point
# of `--frozen-lockfile` in CI); `node_modules/` is not.
node_modules/
